                            </div>
                            <p class="testimonial-text">"I recently ordered Chicken Biryani and Chicken Kharda from Aadya's Non Veg Kitchen and honestly, the taste was outstanding. The biryani had perfect spice balance and the chicken was soft, juicy, and full of flavor. Chicken Kharda had that authentic spicy Maharashtrian touch which made the meal even better. The packaging was neat and hygienic, and the food arrived fresh and hot. You can genuinely feel the homemade quality in every bite. Highly recommended for non-veg lovers."</p>
