                            </div>
                            <p class="testimonial-text">"Being a vegetarian, I tried the Pav Bhaji and Tawa Pulav from Aadya's Non Veg Kitchen and both dishes exceeded my expectations. The Pav Bhaji was buttery, flavorful, and perfectly mashed with fresh vegetables. Tawa Pulav had amazing aroma and street-style taste without being too oily. The hygiene and food quality were clearly maintained very well. Portion size was also satisfying for the price. Definitely ordering again soon with my family."</p>
