                            </div>
                            <p class="testimonial-text">"I ordered Mutton Biryani for dinner and it turned out to be one of the best biryanis I have had in Pune. The rice was long, perfectly cooked, and filled with rich masala flavor. The mutton pieces were tender and cooked beautifully without being chewy. What impressed me most was the cleanliness in packaging and the fresh homemade taste. Aadya's Non Veg Kitchen truly delivers restaurant-quality food with a homely touch."</p>
                            <h5 class="testimonial-name fw-bold mb-0">Vivek</h5>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <!-- Slide 4 -->
