                            </div>
                            <p class="testimonial-text">"Tried Mutton Masala along with Tawa Pulav and the combination was simply amazing. The gravy was rich, spicy, and full of authentic Maharashtrian flavors. The mutton was cooked perfectly and blended very well with the masala. Tawa Pulav complemented the dish perfectly with its smoky and delicious taste. Food quality, hygiene, and presentation were excellent. You can clearly see the passion behind the cooking."</p>
                            <h5 class="testimonial-name fw-bold mb-0">Chaitrali</h5>
                        </div>
