                            <p class="testimonial-text">"I had ordered Chicken Biryani and Pav Bhaji for a small family gathering and everyone loved the food. The biryani was aromatic, flavorful, and had generous chicken pieces. Even the kids enjoyed the Pav Bhaji because it was tasty without being overly spicy. The food was packed hygienically and delivered fresh on time. Aadya's Non Veg Kitchen has now become one of our favorite places for comfort food."</p>
