                            <p class="testimonial-text">"I am very particular about hygiene and taste while ordering food online, and Aadya's Non Veg Kitchen impressed me on both points. I tried Chicken Kharda and Mutton Masala and both dishes had authentic homemade flavors. The spices were perfectly balanced and the quality of meat was excellent. The food was fresh, hot, and packed very neatly. It feels like food made with care and passion rather than commercial cooking."</p>
