                                style="background: rgba(0,0,0,0.15);">
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Main Image with 3D Effect -->
                        <div class="position-relative"
                            style="z-index: 2; transform: perspective(1000px) rotateY(-8deg) rotateX(5deg); transform-style: preserve-3d; transition: transform 0.5s ease;"
                            onmouseover="this.style.transform='perspective(1000px) rotateY(0deg) rotateX(0deg)'"
                            onmouseout="this.style.transform='perspective(1000px) rotateY(-8deg) rotateX(5deg)'">
                            <img src="images/radhika.jpeg" alt="Radhika Sagar Gangavane"
                                class="img-fluid rounded-4 w-100"
                                style="box-shadow: 25px 25px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.5), -10px -10px 30px rgba(255,255,255,0.2); border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.5); aspect-ratio: 4/5; object-fit: cover;">
                        </div>

                        <!-- Experience Badge -->
                        <div class="position-absolute bottom-0 end-0 bg-primary text-white p-4 rounded-4 shadow-lg m-n2 m-md-n3 d-none d-sm-block text-center glass-card"
                            style="border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); z-index: 3;">
                            <h2 class="display-5 fw-bold mb-0 text-white"><span id="years-experience"></span>+</h2>
                            <p class="mb-0 fw-medium">Years of Experience</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-lg-6 fade-up ps-lg-5">
                    <span class="text-primary fw-bold text-uppercase tracking-wide">About Us</span>
                    <h2 class="display-6 fw-bold mt-2 mb-4">Food Passion Since 2020</h2>
                    <p class="lead mb-4">Hello and welcome to Aadya’s Non Veg Kitchen.</p>
                    <p class="mb-3">I am Radhika Sagar Gangavane, and cooking has always been one of the biggest
                        passions of my life. For me, food is not just about recipes or ingredients. It is about
                        emotions, memories, and bringing people together with great taste.</p>
                    <p class="mb-3">Since the beginning, I have loved preparing dishes for family, friends, and guests
                        at home. Whether it was flavorful biryani, delicious non veg dishes, spicy pav bhaji, or
                        homemade comfort meals, people always appreciated my cooking and encouraged me to do something
                        bigger with this passion.</p>
                    <p class="mb-3">Their love, compliments, and support gave me the confidence to start this cloud
                        kitchen journey in 2020. With strong encouragement from my family, I decided to turn my passion
                        into something that could reach more people and make them happy through food.</p>
                    <p class="mb-3">Every dish prepared in my kitchen is made with fresh ingredients, proper hygiene,
                        authentic flavors, and most importantly, genuine care. I always focus on serving food that feels
                        homemade, satisfying, and memorable.</p>
                    <p class="mb-3">Cooking for people and seeing them enjoy the food gives me immense happiness and
                        motivation every single day. My goal has always been simple — to serve delicious food that makes
                        people feel connected, comfortable, and excited for their next meal.</p>
                    <p class="mb-3">Last but not least, I would like to thank my lovable daughter Aadya, who became the
                        inspiration behind starting Aadya’s Non Veg Kitchen and this beautiful journey. Her name will always
                        remain the heart of this dream.</p>
                    <p class="mb-4">Thank you for being part of this journey and supporting my dream. I truly hope every
                        order from our kitchen brings taste, happiness, and beautiful moments to your table.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

